    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00009-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00009">Strictly limited · living artists · published numbers</p>
					<h1 data-interaction-id="e0000a" class="e-ykrhga-e0000a-s e-heading-base">Small editions from living artists, with the numbers left in.</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000b">Every work here is an edition of 40 or fewer, printed by a named studio, signed by the artist. We publish the edition size, the printer, the paper and exactly what the artist is paid.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000c-s " data-id="e0000c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000c">
