</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00026-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00026">Typical work: edition of 25, giclée on Hahnemühle 308gsm, printed at Trace Studio, London. Retail 420. The artist receives 231.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00027 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00027-s " data-id="e00027" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00027">
