    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002o-s " data-id="e0002o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002o">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002p" class="e-ykrhga-e0002p-s e-heading-base">Kiln Field</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002q">Tomas Reidy</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002r">4 of 12 left</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002s">Bench &amp; Rule · Somerset Velvet</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002t">£760</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002u">£418</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002v e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0002v-s " data-id="e0002v" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0002v">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002w-s " data-id="e0002w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002w">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002x" class="e-ykrhga-e0002x-s e-heading-base">Blue Hour Study</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002y">Ana Vidal</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002z">19 of 30 left</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00030-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00030">Trace Studio · Canson Rag 310gsm</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00031-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00031">£295</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00032-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00032">£162</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00033 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00033-s " data-id="e00033" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00033">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00034 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00034-s " data-id="e00034" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00034">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00035" class="e-ykrhga-e00035-s e-heading-base">The Long Field</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00036-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00036">Nia Prosser</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00037-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00037">2 of 8 left</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00038-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00038">Ardal Press · cotton rag, hand-torn</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00039-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00039">£1,180</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003a">£649</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003b">The artist's share is 55% of retail, paid within fourteen days of sale. Printing, framing, shipping, insurance and our own margin come out of the rest, and we will show you that breakdown for any work if you ask for it.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003c-s " data-id="e0003c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003d e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0003d-s " data-id="e0003d" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0003d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003e-s " data-id="e0003e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003e">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0003f-s" data-interaction-id="e0003f" id="82" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-editionable-print_macro.jpg" width="512" height="512" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-editionable-print_macro.jpg 512w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-editionable-print_macro-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-editionable-print_macro-150x150.jpg 150w" alt="Macro detail of a giclée print showing paper grain and ink"/>					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003g">Giclée on 308gsm cotton rag, photographed at 4×. The tooth of the paper is the reason a print does not look like a poster.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003h-s " data-id="e0003h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003h">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003i">For people who have never bought one</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0003j" class="e-ykrhga-e0003j-s e-heading-base">How an edition works</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003k">An edition is a fixed number of prints, made once, signed and numbered, then the file is retired. It is not a poster and it is not a unique painting, and the price sits honestly between them.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003l-s " data-id="e0003l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003m-s " data-id="e0003m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003n-s " data-id="e0003n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003n">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003o-s " data-id="e0003o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003p">01</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003q-s " data-id="e0003q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003q">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003r" class="e-ykrhga-e0003r-s e-heading-base">The artist fixes the number</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003s">Twelve, twenty-five, forty. Whatever it is, it is decided before a single sheet is printed and it never moves.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003t-s " data-id="e0003t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003t">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003u-s " data-id="e0003u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003u">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003v-s " data-id="e0003v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003v">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003w">02</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003x-s " data-id="e0003x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003x">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003y" class="e-ykrhga-e0003y-s e-heading-base">A named studio prints it</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003z">One press run, one paper, one batch of ink. We publish the studio and the stock so you can go and ask them yourself.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00040 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00040-s " data-id="e00040" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00040">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00041 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00041-s " data-id="e00041" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00041">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00042 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00042-s " data-id="e00042" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00042">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00043-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00043">03</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00044 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00044-s " data-id="e00044" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00044">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00045" class="e-ykrhga-e00045-s e-heading-base">The artist signs and numbers it</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00046-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00046">In pencil, in the margin: 7/25. Your number is yours and it is recorded against your name.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00047 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00047-s " data-id="e00047" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00047">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00048 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00048-s " data-id="e00048" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00048">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00049 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00049-s " data-id="e00049" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00049">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004a">04</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004b-s " data-id="e0004b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004b">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004c" class="e-ykrhga-e0004c-s e-heading-base">The file is retired</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004d">No second run, no larger version later, no open edition of the same image. The number on the paper stays true.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004e-s " data-id="e0004e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004f e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0004f-s " data-id="e0004f" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004g-s " data-id="e0004g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004g">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0004h-s" data-interaction-id="e0004h" id="81" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-editionable-gallery_wall.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-editionable-gallery_wall.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-editionable-gallery_wall-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-editionable-gallery_wall-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="A hung gallery wall of framed editions at mixed scale"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004i-s " data-id="e0004i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004i">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004j" class="e-ykrhga-e0004j-s e-heading-base">Framing, hanging, and what a print actually looks like at home</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004k">Buy it unframed and take it to a framer, or add our oak or black frame with museum glass for 95. We ship framed works in a crate and we have broken two in three years.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004l-s " data-id="e0004l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004m">Hang it like this</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004n">Centre at 145cm from the floor, a hand's width above a sofa back, and give a small work more wall than you think it needs. Museum glass kills reflections; north light is kindest to paper.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004o-s " data-id="e0004o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004p e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0004p-s " data-id="e0004p" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004q-s " data-id="e0004q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004q">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004r">The artists, and how we choose them</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004s-s " data-id="e0004s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004s">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004t" class="e-ykrhga-e0004t-s e-heading-base">One in forty</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004u">We take on roughly one artist in forty who approaches us, and we go and see the work in person before we do. Artists keep every right except the edition itself.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004v-s " data-id="e0004v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004v">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004w">No exclusivity clauses, no first refusal on future work, no clause that follows them to a gallery. When an edition sells out, the relationship is finished unless both of us want another one.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004x-s " data-id="e0004x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004x">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0004y-s" data-interaction-id="e0004y" id="80" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-editionable-artist_studio.jpg" width="768" height="1024" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-editionable-artist_studio.jpg 768w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-editionable-artist_studio-225x300.jpg 225w" alt="An artist at work in a daylit studio, prints drying on the wall"/>		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004z-s " data-id="e0004z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00050 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00050-s " data-id="e00050" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00050">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e00051" class="e-ykrhga-e00051-s e-heading-base">Returns, condition and resale</h2>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00052 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00052-s " data-id="e00052" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00052">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00053 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00053-s " data-id="e00053" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00053">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00054 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00054-s " data-id="e00054" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00054">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00055 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00055-s " data-id="e00055" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00055">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00056" class="e-ykrhga-e00056-s e-heading-base">Returns</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00057-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00057">Fourteen days, no reason needed, we pay return shipping. If you get it home and the room says no, that is a completely legitimate reason.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00058 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00058-s " data-id="e00058" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00058">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00059 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00059-s " data-id="e00059" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00059">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005a-s " data-id="e0005a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005a">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005b" class="e-ykrhga-e0005b-s e-heading-base">Condition</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005c">Every work is checked against the studio proof, logged with its number, and shipped flat under tissue in a rigid box, or crated if it is framed.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005d-s " data-id="e0005d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005e-s " data-id="e0005e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005e">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005f-s " data-id="e0005f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005f">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005g" class="e-ykrhga-e0005g-s e-heading-base">Resale</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005h">We keep the register, so we can confirm your number and its condition to a buyer years from now. We take nothing when you sell it on.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005i-s " data-id="e0005i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005j e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005j-s " data-id="e0005j" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005k-s " data-id="e0005k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005k">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005l" class="e-ykrhga-e0005l-s e-heading-base">Four payments</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005m">No interest · no credit check · no lender</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005n-s " data-id="e0005n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005n">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005o">Split anything over 300 into four monthly payments with no interest and no credit check, because it is our money at risk, not a lender's.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005p e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005p-s " data-id="e0005p" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005q-s " data-id="e0005q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005q">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005r">Today</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005s">£105</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005t-s " data-id="e0005t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005t">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005u">Month two</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005v">£105</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005w-s " data-id="e0005w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005w">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005x">Month three</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005y">£105</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005z-s " data-id="e0005z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00060-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00060">Month four</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00061-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00061">£105</p>
		
</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00062-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00062">Example shown on a £420 edition. The work ships on the first payment, not the last.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00063 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00063-s " data-id="e00063" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00063" id="drop">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00064 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00064-s " data-id="e00064" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00064">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00065-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00065">Edition Twelve closes when it sells out</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00066" class="e-ykrhga-e00066-s e-heading-base">Thirty-one works, none of them printed twice.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00067-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00067">Numbers, printers and artist shares published on every one. Fourteen days to change your mind, and we pay the return shipping.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00068-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00068"><a href="#drop" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Browse the current edition
	</a></p>
		
</div>

</section>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00069 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00069-s " data-id="e00069" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00069">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006a-s " data-id="e0006a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006a">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006b-s " data-id="e0006b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006b">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006c-s " data-id="e0006c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006d">Editionable — editions of 40 or fewer, from living artists.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006e">London · hello@editionable.example</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
